	quest.4351715A36CA0DA6.title: "营养液化器"
	quest.436C9C6FF59C4FD5.quest_desc: ["添加到矩阵的每个&b基础感应器&r，都会使矩阵内外每刻的能量传输速率增加&e102.4 kFE&r。"]
	quest.436C9C6FF59C4FD5.title: "基础感应器提供者"
	quest.43985FE38B0EBCB5.quest_desc: [
		"&b基础机械管道&r用于通过管道网络运输&7液体&r。"
		""
		"添加到网络中的每个管道都会增加 &92000mb&r 的缓冲区。该缓冲区也是理论上的总吞吐量。"
		""
		"&9250mb/t&r 的泵速仅适用于每个 \"&cpull&r\" 管道。\"&aPush&r\" 管道不受限制。"
		""
		"For example: If you placed down two \"pull\" pipes, &9500mb/t&r of a &7liquid&r will be pulled into the pipe network, and &9500mb/t&r will be pushed out of it at any available \"&apush&r\" pipes (even only 1 if you have it that way)."
	]
	quest.43985FE38B0EBCB5.title: "基础机械管道"
	quest.44D8D30BCD48C4C9.quest_desc: [
